{"title":"Career: Genetic Engineer","role":"Genetic Engineer","summary":"Role: A Genetic Engineer applies genetic engineering, molecular biology, genomics, and biotechnology to modify, analyse, and engineer genetic material for applications in healthcare, agriculture, industrial biotechnology, diagnostics, research, and synthetic biology.","facts":{},"about":[{"label":"Direct alignment","text":"Very High. Genetic Engineering is directly aligned with this career. The strongest additional skills are molecular cloning, recombinant DNA technology, CRISPR, sequencing, bioinformatics, cell culture, genetic analysis, and laboratory research."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build molecular biology, genetic engineering and laboratory foundations"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in genome engineering, gene therapy, diagnostics, agriculture or synthetic biology"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Lead genetic engineering projects, translational research or biotechnology development"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move toward R&D leadership, advanced genome engineering, biotech innovation or scientific management"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Biological & Engineering Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cell Biology"},{"text":"Genetics"},{"text":"Biochemistry"},{"text":"Microbiology"},{"text":"Chemistry"},{"text":"Mathematics and Statistics"},{"text":"Programming fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Laboratory safety"},{"text":"Microscopy"},{"text":"Pipetting"},{"text":"Buffer preparation"},{"text":"Basic microbial culture"},{"text":"Scientific documentation"},{"text":"Excel and basic Python"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Outcome","text":"Understand how cells, DNA, RNA, proteins and genetic inheritance work."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Molecular Biology & Genetic Engineering"},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Molecular Biology"},{"text":"Genetic Engineering"},{"text":"Recombinant DNA Technology"},{"text":"Immunology"},{"text":"Microbial Genetics"},{"text":"Bioinformatics"},{"text":"Biostatistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Laboratory skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DNA/RNA extraction"},{"text":"PCR"},{"text":"Gel electrophoresis"},{"text":"DNA purification"},{"text":"Restriction digestion"},{"text":"Ligation"},{"text":"Bacterial transformation"},{"text":"Plasmid isolation"},{"text":"Primer design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NCBI"},{"text":"BLAST"},{"text":"UniProt"},{"text":"UCSC Genome Browser"},{"text":"Benchling"},{"text":"Python/R for biological data"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Outcome","text":"Become capable of performing and interpreting basic genetic engineering experiments."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Advanced Genetic Engineering"},{"type":"h","text":"Specialised technologies"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CRISPR-Cas systems"},{"text":"Gene editing"},{"text":"RNA interference"},{"text":"Recombinant protein production"},{"text":"Mammalian cell culture"},{"text":"Viral vectors"},{"text":"DNA sequencing"},{"text":"Next-generation sequencing"},{"text":"Gene expression analysis"},{"text":"qPCR"},{"text":"Western blotting"},{"text":"ELISA"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Computational skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sequence analysis"},{"text":"Genome annotation"},{"text":"Variant analysis"},{"text":"Molecular databases"},{"text":"R/Python for genomics"},{"text":"Basic machine learning for biological datasets"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Industry knowledge"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GLP"},{"text":"GMP"},{"text":"Biosafety"},{"text":"Bioethics"},{"text":"Genetic data privacy"},{"text":"Research documentation"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Outcome","text":"Develop the ability to work on real genetic engineering and genomics projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Industry / Research Specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one primary pathway:"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare & Therapeutics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gene therapy"},{"text":"Cell therapy"},{"text":"CRISPR therapeutics"},{"text":"Molecular diagnostics"},{"text":"Cancer genomics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Agricultural Biotechnology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Genetically engineered crops"},{"text":"Plant genome editing"},{"text":"Molecular breeding"},{"text":"Crop disease resistance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Industrial Biotechnology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Metabolic engineering"},{"text":"Microbial engineering"},{"text":"Recombinant proteins"},{"text":"Biomanufacturing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Synthetic Biology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Genetic circuits"},{"text":"Engineered microorganisms"},{"text":"DNA assembly"},{"text":"Metabolic pathways"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Genomics & Bioinformatics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NGS"},{"text":"Genome analysis"},{"text":"Variant interpretation"},{"text":"Computational genomics"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Final-year project","text":"Prefer an experimental or computational project involving CRISPR, recombinant DNA, genome analysis, synthetic biology, molecular diagnostics or bioinformatics."},{"type":"h","text":"4-Year Honours / Advanced Track"},{"type":"p","text":"For students targeting R&D or postgraduate research:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced molecular cloning"},{"text":"CRISPR-Cas9/Cas12/Cas13 systems"},{"text":"Genome editing"},{"text":"Single-cell genomics"},{"text":"RNA biology"},{"text":"Next-generation sequencing"},{"text":"Gene therapy"},{"text":"Viral-vector engineering"},{"text":"Synthetic biology"},{"text":"Metabolic engineering"},{"text":"Computational genomics"},{"text":"AI-assisted genomics"},{"text":"Protein engineering"},{"te